OL,4,CSeven charged with online child sexual 
OL,5,Cexploitation after police raids        
OL,6,GSix men and a teenage boy have been    
OL,7,Gcharged in connection with online      
OL,8,Gchild sexual exploitation after a      
OL,9,Gseries of police raids in the west and 
OL,10,Gsouth of Scotland.                     
OL,12,FOfficers executed 18 warrants at       
OL,13,Faddresses in the Greater Glasgow,      
OL,14,FAyrshire, Renfrewshire, Dumfries and   
OL,15,FGalloway and Dunbartonshire areas as   
OL,16,Fpart of an "intensification week",     
OL,17,Fbeginning last Monday.                 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
