OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CPolice appeal after woman, 22, raped   
OL,5,Cin Glasgow park                        
OL,6,GDetectives are appealing for           
OL,7,Ginformation after a 22-year-old woman  
OL,8,Gwas raped in Glasgow's Kelvingrove     
OL,9,GPark.                                  
OL,11,FThe woman had been walking through the 
OL,12,Fpark at about 23:50 on Friday when she 
OL,13,Fwas attacked near a bridge from Kelvin 
OL,14,FWalkway.                               
OL,16,FThe suspect is described as being      
OL,17,Fwhite, aged 30-40, about 5ft 10in tall 
OL,18,Fand had a large build. He spoke with   
OL,19,Fan English accent and was wearing a    
OL,20,Fblack hoodie, black trousers and a     
OL,21,Fblack face covering.                   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
